==Strategy==
This stage functions on a time limit and has enemies that get stronger the more you kill them, and you gain points based on Production cost x Points multiplier. Bring as many anti-reds to kill them for the most amount of event points. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] and [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter]] are obvious choices, but use anything that can kill in a quick time and is fairly pricey for maximum points like Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[Hajime Saito (Uber Rare Cat)|Hajime Saito]]. The goal of this stage isn't to win, but to kill as much as possible with the most expensive units, so do that.

Bring [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] and spam them during a fever to keep your money up to buy your expensive units.

Don't forget to bring a critter like [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] for [[THE METAL SLOTH]], as they can waste some of your time in killing them and make you gain less points.

